## Prisma Composer

The application topology is declared in `module.ts` and `src/service.ts`, with deploy configuration in `prisma-composer.config.ts`. {{#if composerPostgres}}Composer provisions Prisma Postgres and injects its connection into the service.{{else}}The database URL is bound as a secret service input from `.env`.{{/if}}

Run `{{runScriptCommand packageManager "deploy"}}` to deploy later changes.
{{/if}}
